{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p13411","chapterId":"s61d5f09691b651b3","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p13411-7f44e77e010efce14038","text":"你反复确认，自己绝对没来过这里，可周身的环境总给你一种回家的感觉。","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p13411-32b81c7a0ba9f9f463a4","text":"你蓦然回首，仿佛见到一位威武的将军与他年轻的骁卫，将军要求骁卫好好记住阶下囚犯的样貌，往日的回声从记忆中缓缓浮现……","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p13411-84e65901daec6cf0a499","text":"「人有五名，代价有三……」","speaker":""}]}
